# Replication target is external scaffolding, NOT project source. The live
# same-disk smoke-test replica lives OUTSIDE this repo at ~/msb-replica (a
# sibling directory). Git can't track a sibling, so this guards against a
# replica dir ever appearing *inside* the repo and being committed.
msb-replica/

